Taken from Noita MCP at commit bc9e917 (bin/xinput_hook.dll: commit 8b3eb21):

  bin/xinput_hook.dll
    Unmodified build of full/extension/xinput_hook.c at 8b3eb21 (DllMain no
    longer waits on its worker thread).
    sha256 effbbc705084287ce5d7ee8a997654aaaaa2f6a36c191dbed574902ffd08c936

  files/json.lua
    From full/mod/noita_agent/files/bridge/json.lua.
    Modified: the global table is renamed from `json` to `rlb_json`.

  files/grid.lua
    Derived from full/mod/noita_agent/files/bridge/advmat.lua (pointer chain,
    addresses and strides; see tools/CELL-MATERIAL-FINDINGS.md).
    Modified: rewritten as a bulk grid reader into a uint16 buffer using the
    LuaJIT bit library, with per-row chunk caching and hex encoding.

  files/bench.lua (seed addresses)
    The two world-seed addresses come from
    full/mod/noita_agent/files/bridge/seedreader.lua.

  files/probes.lua
    Enemy ranged-attack settings and projectile tags were read from the game's
    own data files; no game data is copied into this mod.

  files/link.lua, files/input.lua
    Winsock and DLL-export FFI declarations follow bridge/sock.lua and
    bridge/xinput.lua. The transport (a blocking TCP client with select-based
    waits and newline-delimited JSON) and the action layer are new code.

